    ("The front door is still unlocked and his coat is here—he ______ gone very far.", ["must have", "can't have", "might have", "shouldn't have"], 1, "Silný logický závěr v minulosti, že se něco určitě NESTALO ('coat is here'): 'can't have + V3'.", "Nikoli 'mustn't have' – opak od 'must have' je 'can't have'!"),
