    ("Passengers ______ remain seated with their seatbelts fastened until the aircraft comes to a halt.", ["must", "can", "might", "ought"], 0, "Oficiální předpis / povinnost v letectví a institucích: 'must'.", "Must = pevné pravidlo nebo vnitřní nutnost."),
