    ("You ______ told me earlier that you were vegetarian; I wouldn't have roasted chicken!", ["must have", "could have", "can't have", "needn't have"], 1, "Výčitka, že někdo něco mohl udělat v minulosti, ale neudělal to: 'could have + V3'.", "Could have V3 = mohls to udělat (ale neudělals)."),
    ("During yesterday's storm, the ferry crew ______ evacuate everyone smoothly without panic.", ["could", "was able to", "might", "should"], 1, "Jednorázový konkrétní úspěch v obtížné minulé situaci vyžaduje 'was/were able to' (ne 'could').", "Konkrétní minulý úspěch = was able to / managed to!"),
