    ("You ______ to have checked the tyre pressure before driving four hundred kilometres in frost.", ["should", "ought", "must", "had better"], 1, "Jedině 'ought' se pojí s předložkou 'to': 'ought to have checked' (= měli jste zkontrolovat).", "Ought TO (na rozdíl od should bez 'to')."),
